<blockquote>
  <p>The dropFirst() function accepts a numeric parameter. For <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">for x in array.dropFirst(3)</code>, the output is: 4 5 6.</p>
</blockquote>

<p>Where there’s <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">first</code>, there’s usually <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">last</code></p>

